  "question": {
    "text": "A motor generates an output power of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>220</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math> at an angular velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2100</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>rpm</mi></math>. Calculate&nbsp;the torque (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>) produced by the motor? [Take&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>22</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math>]"
  },
